rings. The Powder King melts. Murmel is owed a tip.'],\n  ['s', 0],\n  ['h', 'MUSIC AND SOUND'],\n  ['w', 'Every note and every voice is written in code. Laughter is an arpeggio. Dialogue is Animalese-style gibberish, one blip a letter.'],\n  ['s', 0],\n  ['h', 'THANKS'],\n  ['w', 'To the players who ride the rails at the speed of the snow.'],\n];\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_017eEssfhB36v5Aj6CYrKxFM","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
