{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cghm8m4SnR1tBeSLPNnEL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WFBdrAsx2tETnuWKenn8do","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > README.md <<'EOF'\n# Skiller7 (dev folder)\n\nThe game's source and tools. The shipped file is `../Skiller7-Killer7-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-023153.html`\n(one file: the engine, its 3D module, the AI Hub client and the game, built by `node tools/build.mjs`).\n\n- `src/` the game, in build order: `00-core` (units, tuning, personas, weapons, Whiteouts, bosses), `10-levels` (rooms,\n  rails, camera shots, waves, pickups, gates, terrain), `20-sim` (the rules, in metres), `30-present` (the 3D world, actors,\n  camera, gun, events), `40-scenes` (title, attract, Room 7, play, dev mode, results, HUD, AI Hub, start), `50-audio`,\n  `60-text` (dialogue, About & Credits), `70-debug` (`game.debug`, the state hash).\n- `engine/` the pinned engine (my-3D2dge v0.85.2 at 4390a98): `my-3d2dge.js`, `my-3d2dge-3d.js`, and its docs.\n- `vendor/aihub/session.js` the AI Hub session client 1.4.0, unmodified.\n- `tools/build.mjs` builds the single HTML (and `out/bundle.js` for the Node tests).\n- `tests/run.mjs` the one test command: builds, runs the rules in Node, then the flows in headless Chromium. Prints only\n  failures and a count. `tests/hub-check.mjs` is the AI Hub mock-parent check (separate: slow under a software renderer).\n- `out/` screenshots and logs (never shipped).\n\nRun: `npm install` once (Playwright 1.63.0), then `node tests/run.mjs`.\nEOF\nexport TMPDIR=$PWD/tmp && (timeout 1500 node tests/run.mjs > out/test-run.log 2>&1; echo \"exit $?\" >> out/test-run.log); tail -4 out/test-run.log","description":"Write the dev README and run the full suite again"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":882,"cache_read_input_tokens":416559,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":882},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bb246035-72d8-4ccb-80ef-f75810865350","uuid":"7f505629-69ef-4316-9646-a31d57a2d6cf","timestamp":"2026-11-04T10:52:30.566Z","request_id":"req_011Cghm8kk6WnaiyHdnPss9z","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01WFBdrAsx2tETnuWKenn8do":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-023153__x696bb3/work/Skiller7-Killer7-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-023153 && cat > README.md <<'EOF'\n# Skiller7 (dev folder)\n\nThe game's source and tools. The shipped file is `../Skiller7-Killer7-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-023153.html`\n(one file: the engine, its 3D module, the AI Hub client and the game, built by `node tools/build.mjs`).\n\n- `src/` the game, in build order: `00-core` (units, tuning, personas, weapons, Whiteouts, bosses), `10-levels` (rooms,\n  rails, camera shots, waves, pickups, gates, terrain), `20-sim` (the rules, in metres), `30-present` (the 3D world, actors,\n  camera, gun, events), `40-scenes` (title, attract, Room 7, play, dev mode, results, HUD, AI Hub, start), `50-audio`,\n  `60-text` (dialogue, About & Credits), `70-debug` (`game.debug`, the state hash).\n- `engine/` the pinned engine (my-3D2dge v0.85.2 at 4390a98): `my-3d2dge.js`, `my-3d2dge-3d.js`, and its docs.\n- `vendor/aihub/session.js` the AI Hub session client 1.4.0, unmodified.\n- `tools/build.mjs` builds the single HTML (and `out/bundle.js` for the Node tests).\n- `tests/run.mjs` the one test command: builds, runs the rules in Node, then the flows in headless Chromium. Prints only\n  failures and a count. `tests/hub-check.mjs` is the AI Hub mock-parent check (separate: slow under a software renderer).\n- `out/` screenshots and logs (never shipped).\n\nRun: `npm install` once (Playwright 1.63.0), then `node tests/run.mjs`.\nEOF\nexport TMPDIR=$PWD/tmp && (timeout 1500 node tests/run.mjs > out/test-run.log 2>&1; echo \"exit $?\" >> out/test-run.log); tail -4 out/test-run.log","description":"Write the dev README and run the full suite again"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01WFBdrAsx2tETnuWKenn8do":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-023153__x696bb3/work/Skiller7-Killer7-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-023153"}}}
